# steps/table-receiver.md §10: bad, a method of the part unit_s7_part_node_src_refused_part.lm2 (harness
# Parts), reads node\got -- node is its lexical parent, the part's root, which declares no got; got is the
# source's field, not in the part's scope: "unresolved name" at got, in the part (the field check's words for a
# single hop, said while the method is checked -- the file of a diagnostic is the file its node was read from).
size_t: got 3U
size_t: r 0U
r: bad()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
